    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuagha wurigha ghwa Jerusalemu sena",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huwu niko wurigha ghwa muzi ghoreaghiloghe sena. Mkohani m'baa Eliashibu orewukieghe chiaimweri na wakohani wambao wikaagha Mbenge ya Ng'ondi sena; wikaiwika wakfu, na kungira minyango yaro. Wikawika wakfu hata Mnara ghwa Ighana na Mnara ghwa Hananeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wereaghieghe luwaru lunughie ni wa Jeriko. Zakuri mwana wa Imri ukaagha luwaru lunughie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kivalwa cha Hasenaa wereaghieghe Mbenge ya Samaki; wikabonya ighombo jaro; wikangira minyango ya mbenge na vuma varo verugha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meremothi mwana wa Uria, wawae Hakozi oreaghieghe luwaru lunughie. Wokoni Meshulamu mwana wa Berekia wawae Meshezabeli ukaagha luwaru lunughie. Na Zadoku mwana wa Baana ukaagha luwaru lunughie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wa Tekoa wereaghieghe luwaru lunughie; ela vilongozi vawo wikalegha kubonya iyo kazi werenekeloghe ni wabaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joida mwana wa Pasea na Meshulamu mwana wa Besodeia wereboisireghe Mbenge ya Kala; wikabonya ighombo, wikangira minyango na vuma varo verugha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Melatia ufumie Gibeoni na Jadoni ufumie Meronothi, na wandu wifumie Gibeoni na Mispa wikaagha luwaru lunughie kuvikia andu m'baa wa isanga jiko magharibi ya Moda ghwa Eufrate ukaiagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzieli mwana wa Harhaia, mchani dhahabu oreaghieghe andu kumu. Hanania m'boisi marumba oreaghieghe andu kumu, hata kuvikia Wurigha Mshapa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Refaia mwana wa Huri, m'bonyi nguma wa nusu ya isanga ja Jerusalemu, ukaagha andu kumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jedaia mwana wa Harumafu oreaghieghe andu kumu kaavui na nyumba yake, na Hatushi mwana wa Hashabneia oreaghieghe andu kumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malkija mwana wa Harimu na Hashubu mwana wa Pahath-moabu wereaghieghe andu kumu chiaimweri na Mnara ghwa Mariko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shalumu mwana wa Haloheshi m'bonyi nguma wa nusu ya isanga ja Jerusalemu oreaghieghe andu kumu, wikateselwa ni wai wake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuni na waisanga wa Zanoa wereaghieghe Mbenge ya Vololo; wikaiagha na kuingira minyango na vuma varo verugha. Wikaboisa wurigha meta maghana ana na mirongo ina hata kuvika Mbenge ya Wuchafu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malkija mwana wa Rekabu m'bonyi nguma wa isanga ja Beth-hakeremu oreiaghieghe Mbenge ya Wuchafu, na kuingiria minyango na vuma varo verugha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shalumu mwana wa Kolhoze, m'bonyi nguma wa isanga ja Mispa, oreaghieghe Mbenge ya Ndoria, ukaifinikira; ukangira minyango na vuma varo verugha. Ukaagha wurigha ghwa Kiriwa cha Shela kaavui na mbuwa ya mzuri, hata kuvikia viluwatiro viseagha kufuma Muzi ghwa Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nehemia mwana wa Azibuku, m'bonyi nguma wa nusu ya isanga ja Beth-zuri, ukaagha hata kuvikia kulangaya makaburi gha Daudi, na kuvikia andu kisima chiaghilo, hata kuvikia nyumba ra majeshi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Walawi awo widumikie wurighenyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walawi winughagha wereaghieghe sena chuwaru ndazi rinughie ra wurigha nawo ni: Rehemu mwana wa Bani oreaghieghe luwaru lunughie, Hashabia m'bonyi nguma wa nusu ya isanga ja Keila: oreaghieghe luwaru lunughie lwa isanga jake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bavai mwana wa Henadadi, m'bonyi nguma wa nusu imu ya isanga ja Keila, ukaagha luwaru lunughie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezeri mwana wa Jeshua, m'bonyi nguma wa Mispa ukaagha luwaru lunughie naimbiri ya nyumba ya maswagha, hata andu wurigha ghughalukiagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baruku mwana wa Zabai, ukaagha luwaru lunughie hata andu kongiria nyumba ya Mkohani M'baa Eliashibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meremothi mwana wa Uria wawae Hakozi ukaagha luwaru lunughie kufuma mnyangonyi ghwa nyumba ya Eliashibu hata kutua kwa nyumba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
