          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wa Tekoa wereaghieghe luwaru lumu luzima lunughie, kufuma andu kulangayagha mnara m'baa gholindia Hekalu hata ghuja wurigha ghuko kaavui na Ofeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kipughi cha wakohani wereaghieghe andu kunughie kughenda cha kaskazinyi kufuma Mbenge ya Farasi kulangaya nyumba rawo kula umu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zadoku mwana wa Imeri ukaagha andu kunughie kulangaya nyumba yake. Shemaia mwana wa Shekania, mlindiri wa Mbenge ya Mashariki oreaghieghe andu kunughie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanania mwana wa Shelemia na Hanuni mwana wa karandadu wa Salafu oreaghieghe andu kunughie kumu kwa kawi. Meshulamu mwana wa Berekia oreaghieghe andu kunughie kulangaya nyumba yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malkija mchani dhahabu oreaghieghe andu kunughie hata kuvikia nyumba ya wadumiki wa Hekalu, na ya wandu wa biashara, kulangaya Mbenge Ekwanyikia hata Hekalunyi, kaavui na chumba cha ighu kona ya wurigha ghwa kaskazinyi mashariki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wachani dhahabu wa Washami nawo wikaagha wurigha ghwa kutua kufuma chumba cha ighu mbembenyi, hata Mbenge ya Ng'ondi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.32"
            ]
          }
        }
